<title>THAILAND: Loxley H1 net rises to 332.66 mln baht.</title>
<headline>Loxley H1 net rises to 332.66 mln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reviewed financial results for the first six months ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Six months</p>
<p>				  1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 8.32     vs	     6.66</p>
<p>    Net			 332.66     vs	   266.37</p>
<p>NOTES: Second quarter figures not available.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Loxley Publications Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950</p>
